<title>SWITZERLAND: Roche to report 1996 sales early Jan 16.</title>
<headline>Roche to report 1996 sales early Jan 16.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roche Holding AG said it would publish 1996 group sales data before the Swiss stock market opens on January 16. It did not give a precise time.</p>
<p>Roche said in October than nine-month sales were up 9.5 percent to 11.73 billion Swiss francs on a comparable basis and that it expected growth to continue in the fourth quarter.</p>
<p>Group sales in 1995 were basically flat at 14.72 billion Swiss francs.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
